{"id": "stories-p12756", "blocks": [{"id": "stories-p12756", "text": "The Warm Copy", "style": "HEADING_1", "sourceParagraph": 12756}, {"id": "stories-p12757", "text": "*Era −2: The Age of Shelter*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12757}, {"id": "stories-p12758", "text": "I have restored over forty-three thousand continuities.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12758}, {"id": "stories-p12759", "text": "That sentence sounds impressive to younger technicians. They imagine triumphs, reunions, and impossible recoveries. They picture someone awakening after disaster, opening unfamiliar eyes, and thanking the people who refused to let them disappear.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12759}, {"id": "stories-p12760", "text": "Most restorations are quieter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12760}, {"id": "stories-p12761", "text": "A technician confirms the continuity record.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12761}, {"id": "stories-p12762", "text": "The embodiment matrix stabilizes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12762}, {"id": "stories-p12763", "text": "The restored person wakes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12763}, {"id": "stories-p12764", "text": "We compare their identity against archived Witness records.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12764}, {"id": "stories-p12765", "text": "If the overlap remains above the legal threshold, the restoration is accepted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12765}, {"id": "stories-p12766", "text": "Families cry.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12766}, {"id": "stories-p12767", "text": "Friends embrace.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12767}, {"id": "stories-p12768", "text": "The record closes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12768}, {"id": "stories-p12769", "text": "I have always preferred quiet endings.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12769}, {"id": "stories-p12770", "text": "Quiet means the mathematics agreed with the people.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12770}, {"id": "stories-p12771", "text": "It means continuity behaved.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12771}, {"id": "stories-p12772", "text": "That changed with Restoration Four-Seven-Eight-One.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12772}, {"id": "stories-p12773", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12773}, {"id": "stories-p12774", "text": "The request arrived during ordinary maintenance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12774}, {"id": "stories-p12775", "text": "**Cause of restoration:** catastrophic embodiment failure.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12775}, {"id": "stories-p12776", "text": "**Witness verification:** complete.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12776}, {"id": "stories-p12777", "text": "**Continuity archive:** intact.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12777}, {"id": "stories-p12778", "text": "**Delay between failure and restoration:** eleven minutes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12778}, {"id": "stories-p12779", "text": "Everything looked routine.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12779}, {"id": "stories-p12780", "text": "I loaded the continuity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12780}, {"id": "stories-p12781", "text": "The embodiment unfolded correctly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12781}, {"id": "stories-p12782", "text": "Neural harmonics aligned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12782}, {"id": "stories-p12783", "text": "Identity resonance stabilized.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12783}, {"id": "stories-p12784", "text": "Witness comparison returned ninety-nine point eight percent agreement.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12784}, {"id": "stories-p12785", "text": "Excellent.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12785}, {"id": "stories-p12786", "text": "The person opened their eyes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12786}, {"id": "stories-p12787", "text": "\"My name is Leth.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12787}, {"id": "stories-p12788", "text": "Correct.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12788}, {"id": "stories-p12789", "text": "\"My partner is Soren.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12789}, {"id": "stories-p12790", "text": "Correct.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12790}, {"id": "stories-p12791", "text": "\"I work in eastern environmental regulation.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12791}, {"id": "stories-p12792", "text": "Correct.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12792}, {"id": "stories-p12793", "text": "\"You are Restoration Technician Mael.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12793}, {"id": "stories-p12794", "text": "Also correct.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12794}, {"id": "stories-p12795", "text": "I smiled.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12795}, {"id": "stories-p12796", "text": "\"Welcome back.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12796}, {"id": "stories-p12797", "text": "Leth smiled too.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12797}, {"id": "stories-p12798", "text": "\"I am glad you convinced Soren not to tell me.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12798}, {"id": "stories-p12799", "text": "I stopped writing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12799}, {"id": "stories-p12800", "text": "\"...Tell you what?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12800}, {"id": "stories-p12801", "text": "\"About the flowers.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12801}, {"id": "stories-p12802", "text": "\"What flowers?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12802}, {"id": "stories-p12803", "text": "Leth looked confused.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12803}, {"id": "stories-p12804", "text": "\"The flowers in the observation garden.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12804}, {"id": "stories-p12805", "text": "\"We've never discussed flowers.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12805}, {"id": "stories-p12806", "text": "\"Yes, we did.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12806}, {"id": "stories-p12807", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12807}, {"id": "stories-p12808", "text": "\"You told Soren they would make me panic.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12808}, {"id": "stories-p12809", "text": "\"I have never met your partner.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12809}, {"id": "stories-p12810", "text": "Silence settled between us.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12810}, {"id": "stories-p12811", "text": "Not frightened silence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12811}, {"id": "stories-p12812", "text": "Confused silence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12812}, {"id": "stories-p12813", "text": "The dangerous kind.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12813}, {"id": "stories-p12814", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12814}, {"id": "stories-p12815", "text": "Identity drift exists.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12815}, {"id": "stories-p12816", "text": "Small differences occur after restoration.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12816}, {"id": "stories-p12817", "text": "A favorite meal becomes less enjoyable.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12817}, {"id": "stories-p12818", "text": "An old fear weakens.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12818}, {"id": "stories-p12819", "text": "Someone forgets the melody of a song they loved.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12819}, {"id": "stories-p12820", "text": "Continuity is preservation, not duplication.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12820}, {"id": "stories-p12821", "text": "We accepted those variations centuries ago.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12821}, {"id": "stories-p12822", "text": "This was different.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12822}, {"id": "stories-p12823", "text": "Leth remembered conversations that had never happened.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12823}, {"id": "stories-p12824", "text": "Not distorted memories.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12824}, {"id": "stories-p12825", "text": "Specific conversations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12825}, {"id": "stories-p12826", "text": "Places.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12826}, {"id": "stories-p12827", "text": "Expressions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12827}, {"id": "stories-p12828", "text": "Pauses.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12828}, {"id": "stories-p12829", "text": "Even my own replies.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12829}, {"id": "stories-p12830", "text": "They spoke with absolute confidence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12830}, {"id": "stories-p12831", "text": "\"You leaned against the northern rail.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12831}, {"id": "stories-p12832", "text": "\"There is no northern rail.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12832}, {"id": "stories-p12833", "text": "\"There was.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12833}, {"id": "stories-p12834", "text": "\"There isn't.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12834}, {"id": "stories-p12835", "text": "\"There was yesterday.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12835}, {"id": "stories-p12836", "text": "Leth's voice faltered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12836}, {"id": "stories-p12837", "text": "\"...Yesterday.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12837}, {"id": "stories-p12838", "text": "The observation garden had been demolished six years earlier.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12838}, {"id": "stories-p12839", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12839}, {"id": "stories-p12840", "text": "I interviewed Soren next.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12840}, {"id": "stories-p12841", "text": "Their grief had barely begun settling.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12841}, {"id": "stories-p12842", "text": "Restoration should have ended it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12842}, {"id": "stories-p12843", "text": "Instead they sat rigidly across from me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12843}, {"id": "stories-p12844", "text": "\"Leth told me about the flowers.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12844}, {"id": "stories-p12845", "text": "\"You've never had that conversation?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12845}, {"id": "stories-p12846", "text": "Soren shook their head.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12846}, {"id": "stories-p12847", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12847}, {"id": "stories-p12848", "text": "\"But...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12848}, {"id": "stories-p12849", "text": "They hesitated.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12849}, {"id": "stories-p12850", "text": "\"There *was* an observation garden.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12850}, {"id": "stories-p12851", "text": "\"I know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12851}, {"id": "stories-p12852", "text": "\"I used to visit one.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12852}, {"id": "stories-p12853", "text": "\"When?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12853}, {"id": "stories-p12854", "text": "\"I don't remember.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12854}, {"id": "stories-p12855", "text": "\"You said six years ago.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12855}, {"id": "stories-p12856", "text": "\"I don't think I did.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12856}, {"id": "stories-p12857", "text": "I reviewed the recording.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12857}, {"id": "stories-p12858", "text": "They had.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12858}, {"id": "stories-p12859", "text": "Soren watched the playback.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12859}, {"id": "stories-p12860", "text": "Their face lost color.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12860}, {"id": "stories-p12861", "text": "\"I don't remember saying that.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12861}, {"id": "stories-p12862", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12862}, {"id": "stories-p12863", "text": "I checked the continuity archive.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12863}, {"id": "stories-p12864", "text": "Perfect.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12864}, {"id": "stories-p12865", "text": "Witness chain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12865}, {"id": "stories-p12866", "text": "Perfect.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12866}, {"id": "stories-p12867", "text": "Embodiment logs.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12867}, {"id": "stories-p12868", "text": "Perfect.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12868}, {"id": "stories-p12869", "text": "Verification.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12869}, {"id": "stories-p12870", "text": "Perfect.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12870}, {"id": "stories-p12871", "text": "Nothing suggested contamination.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12871}, {"id": "stories-p12872", "text": "Nothing suggested corruption.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12872}, {"id": "stories-p12873", "text": "Everything insisted the restoration had succeeded.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12873}, {"id": "stories-p12874", "text": "So why did two people now remember a place erased six years ago?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12874}, {"id": "stories-p12875", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12875}, {"id": "stories-p12876", "text": "I requested access to historical maintenance records.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12876}, {"id": "stories-p12877", "text": "Denied.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12877}, {"id": "stories-p12878", "text": "Classified.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12878}, {"id": "stories-p12879", "text": "I requested archival restoration logs.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12879}, {"id": "stories-p12880", "text": "Denied.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12880}, {"id": "stories-p12881", "text": "Restricted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12881}, {"id": "stories-p12882", "text": "I requested environmental construction history.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12882}, {"id": "stories-p12883", "text": "Granted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12883}, {"id": "stories-p12884", "text": "The observation garden had existed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12884}, {"id": "stories-p12885", "text": "Exactly where Leth described.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12885}, {"id": "stories-p12886", "text": "Exactly as Soren described.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12886}, {"id": "stories-p12887", "text": "It had been dismantled six years ago after structural instability.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12887}, {"id": "stories-p12888", "text": "No anomaly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12888}, {"id": "stories-p12889", "text": "No hidden record.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12889}, {"id": "stories-p12890", "text": "Nothing mysterious.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12890}, {"id": "stories-p12891", "text": "Until I examined the demolition schedule.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12891}, {"id": "stories-p12892", "text": "The garden had been removed three days before Leth's original embodiment failed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12892}, {"id": "stories-p12893", "text": "Not six years.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12893}, {"id": "stories-p12894", "text": "Three days.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12894}, {"id": "stories-p12895", "text": "I stared at the dates.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12895}, {"id": "stories-p12896", "text": "Then I checked again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12896}, {"id": "stories-p12897", "text": "The archive corrected itself.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12897}, {"id": "stories-p12898", "text": "Six years.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12898}, {"id": "stories-p12899", "text": "I opened the earlier copy.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12899}, {"id": "stories-p12900", "text": "Six years.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12900}, {"id": "stories-p12901", "text": "The temporary date no longer existed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12901}, {"id": "stories-p12902", "text": "I began recording my own observations on physical media.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12902}, {"id": "stories-p12903", "text": "Not because I distrusted the archives.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12903}, {"id": "stories-p12904", "text": "Because I suddenly wondered whether they distrusted me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12904}, {"id": "stories-p12905", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12905}, {"id": "stories-p12906", "text": "Over the following week more discrepancies appeared.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12906}, {"id": "stories-p12907", "text": "Leth thanked technicians who had retired decades earlier.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12907}, {"id": "stories-p12908", "text": "A maintenance drone greeted me by a nickname only my childhood mentor had used.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12908}, {"id": "stories-p12909", "text": "An obsolete diagnostic panel asked whether I wanted to continue \"today's inspection.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12909}, {"id": "stories-p12910", "text": "There had been no inspection.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12910}, {"id": "stories-p12911", "text": "Every anomaly vanished before anyone else could verify it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12911}, {"id": "stories-p12912", "text": "When I checked the logs, they showed nothing unusual.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12912}, {"id": "stories-p12913", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12913}, {"id": "stories-p12914", "text": "Then another restoration arrived.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12914}, {"id": "stories-p12915", "text": "Different district.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12915}, {"id": "stories-p12916", "text": "Different person.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12916}, {"id": "stories-p12917", "text": "Routine embodiment failure.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12917}, {"id": "stories-p12918", "text": "Routine recovery.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12918}, {"id": "stories-p12919", "text": "The restored woman looked at me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12919}, {"id": "stories-p12920", "text": "\"You found the garden.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12920}, {"id": "stories-p12921", "text": "Ice spread through my body.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12921}, {"id": "stories-p12922", "text": "\"I've never met you.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12922}, {"id": "stories-p12923", "text": "\"I know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12923}, {"id": "stories-p12924", "text": "\"How do you know that?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12924}, {"id": "stories-p12925", "text": "\"You stood beneath the white trees.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12925}, {"id": "stories-p12926", "text": "\"There are no white trees.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12926}, {"id": "stories-p12927", "text": "\"There aren't now.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12927}, {"id": "stories-p12928", "text": "She looked genuinely sad.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12928}, {"id": "stories-p12929", "text": "\"I hoped you would save them.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12929}, {"id": "stories-p12930", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12930}, {"id": "stories-p12931", "text": "The investigation expanded.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12931}, {"id": "stories-p12932", "text": "Five restored individuals.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12932}, {"id": "stories-p12933", "text": "Then twelve.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12933}, {"id": "stories-p12934", "text": "Then twenty-seven.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12934}, {"id": "stories-p12935", "text": "Every one possessed memories impossible within the official timeline.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12935}, {"id": "stories-p12936", "text": "Yet the impossible memories agreed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12936}, {"id": "stories-p12937", "text": "The same garden.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12937}, {"id": "stories-p12938", "text": "The same bridges.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12938}, {"id": "stories-p12939", "text": "The same conversations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12939}, {"id": "stories-p12940", "text": "The same weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12940}, {"id": "stories-p12941", "text": "The same songs.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12941}, {"id": "stories-p12942", "text": "The same technician.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12942}, {"id": "stories-p12943", "text": "Me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12943}, {"id": "stories-p12944", "text": "Always me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12944}, {"id": "stories-p12945", "text": "Always doing things I had never done.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12945}, {"id": "stories-p12946", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12946}, {"id": "stories-p12947", "text": "The Council assembled a review.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12947}, {"id": "stories-p12948", "text": "Their conclusion arrived quickly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12948}, {"id": "stories-p12949", "text": "Identity bleed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12949}, {"id": "stories-p12950", "text": "A known but extremely rare phenomenon.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12950}, {"id": "stories-p12951", "text": "Adjacent continuity structures can occasionally transfer insignificant experiential residue during restoration.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12951}, {"id": "stories-p12952", "text": "Case closed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12952}, {"id": "stories-p12953", "text": "Except identity bleed had never produced agreement between unrelated people.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12953}, {"id": "stories-p12954", "text": "It had never produced coherent histories.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12954}, {"id": "stories-p12955", "text": "It had never predicted conversations before they occurred.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12955}, {"id": "stories-p12956", "text": "Leth began finishing my sentences.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12956}, {"id": "stories-p12957", "text": "Not because they anticipated me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12957}, {"id": "stories-p12958", "text": "Because they remembered me saying them.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12958}, {"id": "stories-p12959", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12959}, {"id": "stories-p12960", "text": "One evening I visited the restoration chamber alone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12960}, {"id": "stories-p12961", "text": "No active restorations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12961}, {"id": "stories-p12962", "text": "No scheduled work.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12962}, {"id": "stories-p12963", "text": "Only quiet machinery.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12963}, {"id": "stories-p12964", "text": "The embodiment frame powered itself on.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12964}, {"id": "stories-p12965", "text": "No request had been submitted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12965}, {"id": "stories-p12966", "text": "A body began forming.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12966}, {"id": "stories-p12967", "text": "There was no continuity attached.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12967}, {"id": "stories-p12968", "text": "That should have been impossible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12968}, {"id": "stories-p12969", "text": "The frame completed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12969}, {"id": "stories-p12970", "text": "A man opened his eyes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12970}, {"id": "stories-p12971", "text": "He looked exactly like me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12971}, {"id": "stories-p12972", "text": "Not approximately.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12972}, {"id": "stories-p12973", "text": "Exactly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12973}, {"id": "stories-p12974", "text": "He sat upright.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12974}, {"id": "stories-p12975", "text": "\"You finally stayed.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12975}, {"id": "stories-p12976", "text": "I couldn't move.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12976}, {"id": "stories-p12977", "text": "\"Who are you?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12977}, {"id": "stories-p12978", "text": "He frowned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12978}, {"id": "stories-p12979", "text": "\"Mael.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12979}, {"id": "stories-p12980", "text": "\"My name is Mael.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12980}, {"id": "stories-p12981", "text": "\"I know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12981}, {"id": "stories-p12982", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12982}, {"id": "stories-p12983", "text": "He smiled sadly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12983}, {"id": "stories-p12984", "text": "\"I remember when you started saying that.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12984}, {"id": "stories-p12985", "text": "Every instinct told me to terminate the embodiment.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12985}, {"id": "stories-p12986", "text": "Instead I asked,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12986}, {"id": "stories-p12987", "text": "\"What are you?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12987}, {"id": "stories-p12988", "text": "He looked around the chamber.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12988}, {"id": "stories-p12989", "text": "\"...I don't know anymore.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12989}, {"id": "stories-p12990", "text": "He sounded tired.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12990}, {"id": "stories-p12991", "text": "Not frightened.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12991}, {"id": "stories-p12992", "text": "Exhausted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12992}, {"id": "stories-p12993", "text": "\"I keep waking up earlier.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12993}, {"id": "stories-p12994", "text": "\"What do you mean?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12994}, {"id": "stories-p12995", "text": "\"Every restoration.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12995}, {"id": "stories-p12996", "text": "He closed his eyes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12996}, {"id": "stories-p12997", "text": "\"I remember farther back.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12997}, {"id": "stories-p12998", "text": "\"Back where?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12998}, {"id": "stories-p12999", "text": "\"I don't think...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 12999}, {"id": "stories-p13000", "text": "He struggled to answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13000}, {"id": "stories-p13001", "text": "\"...I don't think those memories belong to one life.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13001}, {"id": "stories-p13002", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13002}, {"id": "stories-p13003", "text": "He described places that had never existed together.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13003}, {"id": "stories-p13004", "text": "Shelters separated by centuries.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13004}, {"id": "stories-p13005", "text": "Technologies developed generations apart.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13005}, {"id": "stories-p13006", "text": "People officially recorded as never meeting.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13006}, {"id": "stories-p13007", "text": "Yet every account fit.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13007}, {"id": "stories-p13008", "text": "Not logically.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13008}, {"id": "stories-p13009", "text": "Emotionally.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13009}, {"id": "stories-p13010", "text": "As though history itself had once possessed more paths than the official record retained.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13010}, {"id": "stories-p13011", "text": "\"I remember restoring Leth.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13011}, {"id": "stories-p13012", "text": "\"You've never been a technician.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13012}, {"id": "stories-p13013", "text": "\"I know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13013}, {"id": "stories-p13014", "text": "\"I remember teaching Witnesses.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13014}, {"id": "stories-p13015", "text": "\"You've never been a Witness.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13015}, {"id": "stories-p13016", "text": "\"I know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13016}, {"id": "stories-p13017", "text": "\"I remember planting the white trees.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13017}, {"id": "stories-p13018", "text": "\"There were no white trees.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13018}, {"id": "stories-p13019", "text": "\"There were.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13019}, {"id": "stories-p13020", "text": "He looked directly into me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13020}, {"id": "stories-p13021", "text": "\"And then there weren't.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13021}, {"id": "stories-p13022", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13022}, {"id": "stories-p13023", "text": "The Council erased the recording.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13023}, {"id": "stories-p13024", "text": "Officially it never happened.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13024}, {"id": "stories-p13025", "text": "No embodiment frame activated.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13025}, {"id": "stories-p13026", "text": "No duplicate existed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13026}, {"id": "stories-p13027", "text": "No unauthorized continuity was restored.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13027}, {"id": "stories-p13028", "text": "When I requested the archived footage the next morning, the chamber remained empty for the entire night.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13028}, {"id": "stories-p13029", "text": "Perfectly empty.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13029}, {"id": "stories-p13030", "text": "I almost accepted it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13030}, {"id": "stories-p13031", "text": "Then I found soil beneath my fingernails.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13031}, {"id": "stories-p13032", "text": "Real soil.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13032}, {"id": "stories-p13033", "text": "Impossible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13033}, {"id": "stories-p13034", "text": "Digital environments did not produce physical residue.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13034}, {"id": "stories-p13035", "text": "I washed my hands.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13035}, {"id": "stories-p13036", "text": "One grain remained beneath my thumbnail.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13036}, {"id": "stories-p13037", "text": "It was white.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13037}, {"id": "stories-p13038", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13038}, {"id": "stories-p13039", "text": "Years later I stopped performing restorations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13039}, {"id": "stories-p13040", "text": "Officially I retired due to accumulated cognitive fatigue.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13040}, {"id": "stories-p13041", "text": "Unofficially I no longer trusted success.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13041}, {"id": "stories-p13042", "text": "Every restoration now left me wondering whether continuity had merely preserved one life...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13042}, {"id": "stories-p13043", "text": "...or gathered together fragments from many possible ones.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13043}, {"id": "stories-p13044", "text": "The Council insisted identity bleed was insignificant.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13044}, {"id": "stories-p13045", "text": "The Witnesses quietly stopped using that phrase.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13045}, {"id": "stories-p13046", "text": "Among restoration technicians another expression appeared.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13046}, {"id": "stories-p13047", "text": "No one admitted inventing it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13047}, {"id": "stories-p13048", "text": "No one wrote it into manuals.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13048}, {"id": "stories-p13049", "text": "We only whispered it to new apprentices when the chamber doors closed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13049}, {"id": "stories-p13050", "text": "\"Not every restored person comes back alone.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13050}, {"id": "stories-p13051", "text": "The apprentices usually laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13051}, {"id": "stories-p13052", "text": "Until their first impossible memory.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13052}, {"id": "stories-p13053", "text": "Then they stopped laughing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13053}, {"id": "stories-p13054", "text": "They simply asked the same question every technician eventually asked.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13054}, {"id": "stories-p13055", "text": "\"If these memories belong to no recorded life...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13055}, {"id": "stories-p13056", "text": "\"...who has been remembering them all this time?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13056}], "outline": [{"id": "stories-p12756", "title": "The Warm Copy", "level": 1}]}